body:grpc {
  [
    {}
  ]
}

docs {
  The single queue of "where am I needed, and in what order", across ALL the active
  account's demands.

  **There is no RPC to mark as read or dismiss**, and the absence is design: an item
  is born of an event and dies of an event. An item that vanishes without the
  problem having been solved is a comfortable lie, and a box that lies becomes a box
  that is ignored.

  `priority` is DERIVED (the kind's impact, then age) and computed on the READ — age
  changes on its own, and a materialized priority would go stale in silence. A lower
  number = more urgent.

  `open_total` is the badge's number: counting the page would give a badge that
  changes when you paginate.
}
